      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"whatever feels lighter.\" that's a scary way to put it. but i guess it makes sense. like, why am i fighting so hard to keep a flame lit in a vacuum? it just feels like i'm exhausted from pretending that this struggle has a purpose when it clearly doesn't.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
